      "message": "Sending the entire data buffer means that some of the fuzz data is being reused for multiple purposes, which may make it difficult for the fuzzer to reach certain cases.\n\nRather than writing the entire data buffer, this should probably consume a random number of bytes, something like:\n\nsize_t writeBufferSize \u003d fdp.ConsumeIntegral\u003cuint16_t\u003e();\nstd::vector\u003cuint8_t\u003e writeBuffer \u003d fdp.ConsumeBytes(writeBufferSize);\nsource-\u003eWrite(writeBuffer.data(), writeBuffer.size());",
